fngine
A C++/CUDA inference engine for Qwen3.8-Flash-Next on one RTX 5090.

fngine is derived in part from Cinference (commit 383e5db), which is derived
from NInfer. Files copied or adapted from those projects carry a header of the
form "Modified for fngine from <project>:<path> @ <commit>. See NOTICE."
The Apache License, Version 2.0 text is retained unchanged in LICENSE.

