44e9603cac541afb5bb5e637da4c0e45653e62e3

Modifications by fngine: the copied runtime, kernel, frontend and serving code
is restricted to the Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (qwen4_exp) text model, re-instantiated
for hidden size 2560, four residual streams with gated-residual mixing, 36 Gated
DeltaNet and 12 sparse-attention layers, CPU/GPU split mixture-of-experts with
native GGUF i-quant experts, and an n-gram (PLE) embedding read from storage.
Vision, DFlash2, verify trees, NVFP4 and multi-request batching are removed.

